{"id":"msg_m_ex_dorothy_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_dorothy","label":"Dorothy · Nikke"},"label":"2. Your Grace,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_dorothy_01","next":"msg_m_ex_dorothy_03","speakers":{"dorothy":"Dorothy"},"icons":{"dorothy":"si_c233_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_1","text":"Your Grace,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_2","text":"have you seen Isabel recently?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_3","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_3","text":"Yes, I have.","jump":"m_ex_dorothy_02_8"},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_4","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_4","text":"No, I haven't","jump":"m_ex_dorothy_02_5"},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_5","text":"Are you sure","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_6","text":"you are telling me the truth?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_7","text":"... I've seen her.","jump":"m_ex_dorothy_02_8"},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_8","text":"Did anything unusual happen","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_9","text":"when you last saw her?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_10","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_10","text":"No, I guess not.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_11","text":"You guess?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_12","text":"That's rather vague.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_13","text":"I didn't feel like anything out of the ordinary happened.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_14","text":"That's good to hear.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_15","text":"Isabel has been acting rather erratic recently.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_16","text":"Be forewarned,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_17","text":"once she fixates on someone, she can potentially become a danger to herself and others.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_18","text":"She's a bit headstrong, and can go a bit overboard at times.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_19","text":"So long as she doesn't take it too far.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_20","text":"At any rate, it's clear that her most recent fixation is you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_21","text":"Be that as it may,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_22","text":"do not let her steamroll over you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_23","text":"You humoring her may cause her to act like a spoiled child.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_24","text":"Understood.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_25","text":"There's no need to be overly concerned.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_26","text":"I'm confident that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_27","text":"you won't let anything unfortunate happen.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_28","text":"Is there anything else noteworthy?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_29","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_29","text":"Noah is always harassing me.","jump":"m_ex_dorothy_02_31"},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_30","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_30","text":"Harran is always harassing me.","jump":"m_ex_dorothy_02_40"},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_31","text":"Yes, Noah...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_32","text":"I'm afraid I cannot help you there.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_33","text":"Does she tease you relentlessly as well?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_34","text":"Oddly enough, no.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_35","text":"On the contrary,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_36","text":"she is nothing but well-behaved around me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_37","text":"She and I get along quite well,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_38","text":"so I find her rather endearing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_39","text":"I'm sorry to see that you have not had the same experience with her.","jump":"m_ex_dorothy_02_50"},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_40","text":"Harran...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_41","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_42","text":"She doesn't tend to bully others for no reason.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_43","text":"Perhaps you've done something that rubbed her the wrong way.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_44","text":"Or maybe she merely gets a kick out of getting your goat.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_45","text":"Did I do something wrong?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_46","text":"No.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_47","text":"I don't think so.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_48","text":"If that was the case, you'd already be dead.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_49","text":"Harran wouldn't waste her time on someone she didn't find intriguing.","jump":"m_ex_dorothy_02_50"},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_50","text":"In fact, I think she may be interested in you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_51","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_51","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_52","text":"From the looks of it,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_53","text":"you're receiving no small amount of attention","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_54","text":"from our squad.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_55","text":"If there's nothing else, you should go get some rest.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_02_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_02_56","text":"See you around.","jump":null}],"chat":true}